---
title: Mezcal Margarita
servings: 1
tags: [cocktail, mezcal]
source: Classic cocktail, number 34 on Drinks International's 2026 bestselling classics; method written for this repository
---

Rub a #rocks glass{} rim with lime, dip it in @kosher salt{}, and fill the glass with ice. In a #cocktail shaker{}(with ice), pour @mezcal{2%fl_oz}, @orange liqueur{0.75%fl_oz} and @lime juice{1%fl_oz}. Shake briskly for ~{10%seconds}, and strain into the glass. Garnish with a @lime{1%wedge}.

> Half tequila and half mezcal is a gentler start.
